OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is there a sword in a stone in
OL,4,ACounty Durham?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe puzzle of how a sword in a stone
OL,7,Femerged on a nature trail has been
OL,8,Fsolved after its creator spoke out.
OL,10,FThe attraction has sat on the corner of
OL,11,Fa footpath in Dawdon, near Seaham,
OL,12,FCounty Durham, for about three years.
OL,14,FThe stone's existence was not common
OL,15,Fknowledge but a photo of it sparked
OL,16,Fcuriosity on social media as people
OL,17,Ftried to guess its location.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
