OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is there a sword in a stone in
OL,4,ACounty Durham?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, it turned out the object's
OL,7,Fappearance was not shrouded in mystery
OL,8,F- it was made by former miner Desmond
OL,9,FConsitt using steel, wood and.... a
OL,10,Fgolf ball.
